sable the double jump.\n\n-- the ⚙️ (settings of dj) function:\nWhen u click on the 𝗴𝗲𝗮𝗿 (close to the on/off toggle) it will make apper an window where I can set 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝘀𝗲𝗰𝗼𝗻𝗱 𝗷𝘂𝗺𝗽 𝗽𝗼𝘄𝗲𝗿 (minimum: 40; maximum: 80) or delete the entire logic, GUI (all) of the DJ script.\n\n-- ! DON'T USE IN GAMES WITH ANTI- INF JUMP, still not tested in this type of games, like Forsaken !\n\n                                  ~~ Soon update... Updated ! Version 0.75 is out! ~~\n\n# ᴍᴀᴅᴇ ʙʏ ᴀᴄᴇʟᴇsᴛᴜᴢ","tags":["Double Jump","double jump","Jump","universal","FE"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","username":"AcelestuZ","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/598cf3a48c609f258923458b0b9812d736bbdbc025f46e8e1ce959f90733338a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb-1766412387069.png"},"status":"offline","id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/598cf3a48c609f258923458b0b9812d736bbdbc025f46e8e1ce959f90733338a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb-1766412387069.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:36:00.478Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69495a64f3f1f1ae59b6f961","editBy":{"_id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","username":"AcelestuZ","status":"offline","id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-12-22T14:49:08.816Z"},{"_id":"6963cc0989eac87a14d6b87d","editBy":{"_id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb","username":"AcelestuZ","status":"offline","id":"693ffd559b445894f4f7faeb"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-01-11T16:12:57.488Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"695d724df1e3faff027449e9","commentBy":{"_id":"65a1f4a490fcb8835c097696","username":"Aabbaaii13","verified":false,"role":"user","p